== ui_card "Form Helpers"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_text_field(name, value, url:, **options)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Slim-Pickins focuses on <strong>Inline Editing</strong> as a primary data interaction pattern. Instead of heavy modal forms, we encourage editing data right where it lives.
  ul
    li <strong>Seamless:</strong> Click-to-edit interactions feel lightweight.
    li <strong>Progressive:</strong> Look like text, act like an input.
    li <strong>AJAX-Ready:</strong> Built-in Stimulus controllers handle the save-on-blur lifecycle.

  h3 Arguments
  table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem;"
    thead style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sp-border);"
      tr
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Name
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Type
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Description
    tbody
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" name
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The form field name (used in the POST request).
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" value
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The current value to display.
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" url
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The endpoint to POST changes to.
      tr
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" options
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Hash
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Additional attributes.

  h3 Real World Scenarios
  
  h4 1. Inline Rename
  p Allow a user to rename a resource instantly.
  
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
